            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Konrad Lorenz's Early Life</strong><br>\nKonrad Lorenz was born on November 7, 1903, in Vienna, Austria. From an early age, he was fascinated by animals, spending much of his time observing and interacting with them. His father was an orthopedic surgeon who encouraged his scientific interests, leading Lorenz to study both medicine and zoology at the University of Vienna. He received his doctoral degree in zoology in 1928, after which he began to focus on the study of animal behavior.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Contribution to Ethology</strong><br>\nKonrad Lorenz is known as one of the founding fathers of ethology, which is the scientific study of animal behavior, especially as it occurs in a natural environment. He made groundbreaking contributions to the understanding of how innate behavioral patterns are passed down from one generation to the next. Lorenz's work helped to reveal the complex interplay between instinct and learned behavior in animals.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Animal Behavior Studies</strong><br>\nLorenz's studies often involved close observations of greylag geese and jackdaws. He discovered that goslings follow the first moving object they see after hatching—a phenomenon known as imprinting. This work not only provided insights into animal psychology but also influenced ideas on human behavior and child development. Lorenz demonstrated that imprinting is a critical period, a fixed stage when certain experiences have a lasting impact on the behavior of an animal.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
